        <briefdescription>
<para>Creates a signed JWT from the client&apos;s identity and stores it in the data. </para>
        </briefdescription>
        <detaileddescription>
<para>Signs a JWT from the client&apos;s identity and writes it back to <computeroutput>clientLoginData</computeroutput>.</para>
<para><parameterlist kind="param"><parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername direction="inout">clientLoginData</parametername>
</parameternamelist>
<parameterdescription>
<para>Supplies claims and receives the generated token. </para>
</parameterdescription>
</parameteritem>
</parameterlist>
<simplesect kind="return"><para>True when a token was produced; false on a signing/configuration error. </para>
</simplesect>
<simplesect kind="note"><para>The token embeds the issue/expiry times and last-logout time; signing failures are logged via <ref refid="classMessage_1aa085f3b7f644c7c1075eac59e3c2f7a9" kindref="member">Message::CriticalMessage</ref>. </para>
</simplesect>
<simplesect kind="note"><para>Failure paths (missing claims, signing exception) are covered by tests/gatekeeper/test_tokenmanager.cpp.</para>
</simplesect>
<simplesect kind="return"><para>True on success; false when signing throws (reported as a critical message). </para>
</simplesect>
<simplesect kind="see"><para><ref refid="classapi_1_1v2_1_1TokenManager_1ae35221cdefeaad8255a896481af08403" kindref="member">TokenManager::generateToken</ref> </para>
</simplesect>
</para>
